Z||000005||Old Lar||03-08-2001||08:09 AM||||I can vouch for the tgowens seat covers.  I got one for my 87 GT's driver seat from Terry and it was like mint. A reasonable price at twice the cost.  LOL.  Its now on the seat and the seat is in the car.<P>Unless you go the rout of the swap, the original fabric is unavailable.||||reg||1
